	#;=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
LOWER	; Parse LOWER functions here ; MRP584 ; DPV1113 - Made it not a built-in function
